# Keep the small, human-readable artifacts the backend and the report depend on.
# The .joblib pickle is deliberately NOT tracked: the backend loads the JSON weights
# instead, to avoid deserialising a pickle at runtime.
!data_pipeline/artifacts/hybrid_match_weights.json
!data_pipeline/reports/*.json
!data_pipeline/reports/*.png
